# Property dashboard QA — agent reference

When reviewing or verifying **property-scoped** dashboard work (`/org/:orgSlug/property/:propertySlug/*`), follow **`.agent/skills/property-dashboard-qa/SKILL.md`**.

## Must

1. Prefer **live UI** (Playwright / browser) over docs-only review.
2. Write findings under **`docs/workflow/qa/property-dashboard/`** (per-module files + README).
3. Fix or flag bare deep-links (`/bookings`, `/finance`, …) — always use `propertySectionPath`.
4. Check **plan gates** (`plans-feature-matrix.md`) and **team templates** (Full Access / Operations / Read Only).
5. Update matching **`docs/guides/routes/org/property/*.md`** when product and docs disagree.
6. For deep passes, follow skill § **Deep interaction pass** / **Phase 4** (Settings save, Marketing download, GAF, Telegram live preview, Meta OAuth start) and write `18-` / `19-*.md` evidence. Never log bot tokens or Meta secrets.

## Out of scope here

Org-level pages and parking module — separate QA passes later.
